---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Affiliate disclosure';
const description = 'How Screening Atlas may earn money from links to tenant screening and landlord software providers, and which links are affiliate links.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p><strong>Current status (November 18, 2026): we have no affiliate relationships.</strong> Every provider link on this site goes to the provider's public website, and we earn nothing from it.</p>
  <p>We may apply to affiliate programs run by providers we write about, such as TransUnion SmartMove, TurboTenant, RentRedi, Rentec Direct and RentPrep. If a program approves us, links to that provider may become affiliate links: if you click one and later buy or sign up, the provider may pay us a commission at no extra cost to you. When that happens we'll update this page with the date and the provider.</p>
  <p>When a program approves us, those links will be marked <span class="aff-tag">affiliate link</span> and will carry <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. Until then, provider links are ordinary links, and we earn nothing from them.</p>
  <h2>Our rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions never change a fact, a price, or the order of a table.</li>
    <li>If a commission-paying provider is the worse choice for a situation, we say so.</li>
    <li>We include providers that don't pay us whenever leaving them out would make a comparison worse.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
